  "releaseNotes": "## 1.7.0\n### Features\n- add\n```\nSystem\n    Collections.Generic\n        KeyValuePair\n    Math\n        Tau\n    MathF\n        Tau\n    Runtime\n        CompilerServices\n            RawArrayData\n            RawData\n        InteropServices\n            MemoryMarshal\n                GetArrayDataReference(T[])\n    TimeSpan\n        HoursPerDay\n        MicrosecondsPerDay\n        MicrosecondsPerHour\n        MicrosecondsPerMillisecond\n        MicrosecondsPerMinute\n        MicrosecondsPerSecond\n        MillisecondsPerDay\n        MillisecondsPerHour\n        MillisecondsPerMinute\n        MillisecondsPerSecond\n        MinutesPerDay\n        MinutesPerHour\n        NanosecondsPerTick\n        SecondsPerDay\n        SecondsPerHour\n        SecondsPerMinute\n        TicksPerMicrosecond\n```\n- change\n```\n;old\nSystem.Collections.Generic\n    KeyValuePair\n        Deconstruct()\n;new\nSystem.Collections.Generic\n    KeyValuePair`2\n        Deconstruct()\n```\n### Bug Fixes\n- ArgumentException occurred during the initial build of a multi-threaded environment",
